    NIJAH "내게 비밀 없이 대해줘... 네가 무엇이든 상관없어."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_4.rpy:50
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_2_afterAction_2988b59d:

    # NIJAH "{i}Because of who you are...{/i}"
    NIJAH "{i}네가 어떤 사람인지가 중요하니까...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_4.rpy:54
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_2_afterAction_2d89b62a:

    # "We have spent some time together, and I finally felt calming down after the night's events."
    "우리는 함께 시간을 보냈고, 나는 밤의 사건 이후 마침내 마음이 진정되는 걸 느꼈다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_4.rpy:55
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_2_afterAction_e55fad8b:

    # "I walked Nijah to her home, which turned out to be not that far from mine."
    "나는 니자를 그녀의 집까지 바래다주었는데, 내 집에서 그리 멀지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_4.rpy:58
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_2_afterAction_77636738:

    # "Saying our goodbyes, Nijah gave me a warm embrace as she disappeared inside her house."
